  "app_id": 2795090,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "MR FARMBOY is a colony farming game with automation. Build your dream farm , grow crops, raise animals, attract villagers, and hire workers to automate everything . 🌱 Grow and Harvest Crops Plant, water, and harvest a variety of crops on your dream farm. 🐓 Raise Animals Build Coops to raise chickens, ducks and geese, Barns to raise pigs, sheep, and cows. 🏗️ Build Your Farm Construct Markets, Houses, Warehouses , Coops, Barns, and more to grow your farming empire. 🛠️ Automate Your Farm Hire Farmers, Gatherers, and Carriers to fully automate production and logistics. 💰 Sell to Villagers Attract villagers to your farm and sell your goods to them. 🧘 Relax and Strategize Enjoy the atmosphere while optimizing your farm’s automation."
  },
  "detailed_descriptions_html": {
