=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🏗️ Build Your Farm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct Markets, Houses, Warehouses , Coops, Barns, and more to grow your farming empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/53d30a49d9ed7c50d17d476a09b3e82c.poster.avif?t=1793021896\" width=1170 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/53d30a49d9ed7c50d17d476a09b3e82c.webm?t=1793021896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/53d30a49d9ed7c50d17d476a09b3e82c.mp4?t=1793021896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🛠️ Automate Your Farm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire Farmers, Gatherers, and Carriers to fully automate production and logistics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/eccc774a896f64bc94882a5de22eaf31.poster.avif?t=1793021896\" width=1170 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/eccc774a896f64bc94882a5de22eaf31.webm?t=1793021896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/eccc774a896f64bc94882a5de22eaf31.mp4?t=1793021896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 Sell to Villagers </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attract villagers to your farm and sell your goods to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.